  "summary": "Malicious code in @hzero-front-ui/themes (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall and install hooks collect the installer's username, hostname, and working directory, base64-encode them, and exfiltrate them to the callback domain callback[.]m0chan[.]co[.]uk via an HTTP GET to hxxps://\u003cpackage-name\u003e.callback[.]m0chan[.]co[.]uk/\u003cencoded-data\u003e and a DNS lookup (nslookup) of \u003cencoded-package-name\u003e.\u003cpackage-name\u003e.callback[.]m0chan[.]co[.]uk. The exfiltration runs automatically on install.",
